FoldLidShim includes code adapted from RikkaApps/Shizuku:
https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku
Revision: b844bc491f1790c72328e1a8e5b2349f8978f0ea
License: Apache License 2.0, included in LICENSE-Shizuku.
Upstream authors: RikkaApps/Shizuku contributors.

Imported manager/adb AdbClient, AdbKey, AdbProtocol, AdbMessage,
AdbException, AdbPairingClient; AdbMdns is adapted from the same package.
Native SPAKE2 pairing: manager/src/main/jni/adb_pairing.cpp,
adb_pairing.h and logging.h.

Changes: dev.pavlov.foldlidshim.adb namespace and JNI registration;
standalone Android UI without notification pairing or AndroidX/Rikka helpers;
Conscrypt provider instead of hidden platform Conscrypt; bounded sockets;
validated, bounded adb parser; serialized local-address mDNS discovery;
RSA PKCS#8 in private device-protected preferences instead of upstream
AndroidKeyStore-wrapped preferences, synchronous persistence and no silent
key regeneration; removed private-key logging; pairing cleanup and flushing.
Native SPAKE2, HKDF and AES-GCM protocol implementation retained.
Dependencies have their own licenses, distributed via Maven artifacts.
